    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels different this time though. it wasn't just fear. it was like i knew i should have moved and i just chose to stay still. it's like there's this rot in my soul. i look in the mirror and i just see someone who doesn't even deserve to be here. i feel like a parasite just taking up space.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
